    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nStone Cottage, a two-bedroom terraced bungalow, situate in Loughrea, Co. Galway, has its origins dating back to the 1900's. With careful planning and execution and the use of modern building techniques and sustainable building materials, the cottage was completely renovated in 2013.\n\nThe dwelling has been gutted, new plumbing and heating installed, new flooring, insulation, walls and partitions, chimney stack, new energy efficient windows, doors, fixtures and fittings.\nThe original stone structure of the cottage was retained and expertly repointed and restored to it's original glory. The result is a charming, visually pleasing, functional and sustainable home. Although a terraced home, there is vehicular access (a right of way) to the left of the adjoining house, giving access to the courtyard and garden. The generous sized garden has mature trees, to include plum and apple trees, and shrubbery which define the perimeter of the site and give complete privacy to the occupants.\nThere is potential for further development for a studio room in the garden which could be rented under the rent a room scheme. A stone shed doubles up as a storage unit/ boiler house and recreation area. Additionally, a wooden garden tool shed with galvanised roof and overhang, sits unobtrusively in the garden.\n\nInternally the accommodation consists of a sitting room with wood burning stove and impressive red brick chimney stack, a modern kitchen, bathroom with bath and overhead electric shower and two bedrooms, one double one single. In addition to an oil fired central heating system, a back boiler connected to the stove, also heats the radiators and water. The property has been tastefully decorated and presents in excellent condition.\n\nViewing strictly by appointment through selling agent."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nLiving Room/ Dining Room - 4.37m x 4.32m\nWood burning stove with back boiler. Feature brick chimney stack. Quality laminate flooring.\n\nKitchen - 2.31m x 3.04m\nFitted L shape kitchen with electric under-counter oven, electric hob and under-counter fridge freezer. Tiled flooring and splash back.\n\nBathroom - 3.08m x 1.53m\nFully tiles with bath and overhead electric shower. Frosted side aspect window.\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.52m x 3.25m\nDouble size bedroom with quality laminate flooring, curtains and venetian blinds.\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.21m x 3.32m\nLarge single room, quality laminate flooring, curtains and venetian blind.\n\nLinen Press - 1.00m x 1.04m\nFully shelved with insulated cylinder.\n\n - \n- Fully renovated and beautifully finished two-bedroom terraced bungalow with a generous size garden.- Upgraded plumbing and heating systems, flooring, insulation, chimney stack, walls and partitions. Double glazed windows and doors.- Oil fired central heating, a back boiler connected to the stove also heats the radiators and water.- Large garden with mature trees, stone shed and wooden garden shed.- Central location, short walking distance to Loughrea town centre.\n\n"
      },
